---
import Stop from "../Stop.astro";
---

<Stop id="notify" title="A Telegram message when it is done" log="!142 notified">
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      Add a Telegram target with a bot token and a chat, and a topic thread if the chat uses
      them. 4R sends it a message when a review finishes and when a release routine reaches
      its notify step. Pick the chat from the bot's recent updates instead of copying IDs, and
      send a test message before you rely on it.
    </p>
    <p>
      Notification rules are global or per repository; a repository's own rules replace the
      global ones for that repository. A message that fails to send is logged and never holds
      up the review.
    </p>
  </div>
</Stop>
